{
  "_comment": "Ground truth from Factorio 2.1.12 (Space Age) via test/oracle. Measures the cliff_smoothing STENCIL rather than deriving it. A DELTA probe `1 + 1000 * if(1 - abs(x - X0), 1, 0)` is routed onto property_expression_names.cliff_elevation with cliff_smoothing left at 1, cliff_elevation_interval=1e6 (a single contour) and richness=4 (the cliffiness gate held open). Every corner except column X0/4 carries the constant 1, so the smoothed field is exactly 1 + 1000*w(i) where w(i) is the weight corner i gives the knot at X0/4 - the game's cliffs at cliff_elevation_0=500 therefore trace the w=0.5 contour of the stencil itself. Four column arms and four row arms cover in-chunk indices 0, 3, 4 and 7 on both axes. The in-chunk-3 arms are the load-bearing ones: 3 is NOT a knot under `smoothingKnots`, so the model predicts the game places NOTHING, and an empty prediction cannot be satisfied by a stencil that is merely close. Forced surface seed like every other Vulcanus fixture. Regenerate: node --experimental-strip-types test/oracle/capture.ts cliff-smoothing-stencil",
